{
  "mn2:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 2 ",
  "mn2:0.2": "Sabbāsavasutta ",
  "mn2:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn2:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn2:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn2:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "mn2:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn2:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn2:2.1": "“sabbāsavasaṁvarapariyāyaṁ vo, bhikkhave, desessāmi. ",
  "mn2:2.2": "Taṁ suṇātha, sādhukaṁ manasi karotha, bhāsissāmī”ti. ",
  "mn2:2.3": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn2:2.4": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn2:3.1": "“Jānato ahaṁ, bhikkhave, passato āsavānaṁ khayaṁ vadāmi, no ajānato no apassato. ",
  "mn2:3.2": "Kiñca, bhikkhave, jānato kiñca passato āsavānaṁ khayaṁ vadāmi? ",
  "mn2:3.3": "Yoniso ca manasikāraṁ ayoniso ca manasikāraṁ. ",
  "mn2:3.4": "Ayoniso, bhikkhave, manasikaroto anuppannā ceva āsavā uppajjanti, uppannā ca āsavā pavaḍḍhanti; ",
  "mn2:3.5": "yoniso ca kho, bhikkhave, manasikaroto anuppannā ceva āsavā na uppajjanti, uppannā ca āsavā pahīyanti. ",
  "mn2:4.1": "Atthi, bhikkhave, āsavā dassanā pahātabbā, atthi āsavā saṁvarā pahātabbā, atthi āsavā paṭisevanā pahātabbā, atthi āsavā adhivāsanā pahātabbā, atthi āsavā parivajjanā pahātabbā, atthi āsavā vinodanā pahātabbā, atthi āsavā bhāvanā pahātabbā. ",
  "mn2:5.0": "1. Dassan